Poêle","min":8}},{"text":"Verse la crème et mélange avec les pâtes.","timer":null}],"kids":true},{"title":"Endives au jambon et au maroilles","intro":"Le gratin d'endives avec le caractère du maroilles.","minutes":60,"calories":540,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"endive gratin strong cheese","veg":false,"oven":true,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Spécialité du Nord","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"endive","plural":"endives","qty":8,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"jambon blanc","plural":"jambon blanc","qty":8,"unit":"tranches","have":false},{"name":"maroilles","plural":"maroilles","qty":0.5,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"beurre","plural":"beurres","qty":40,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"farine","plural":"farines","qty":40,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"lait","plural":"laits","qty":50,"unit":"cl","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"poivre","plural":"poivres","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Fais cuire les endives 20 min et égoutte-les bien.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":20}},{"text":"Prépare la béchamel avec le beurre, la farine et le lait.","timer":null},{"text":"Préchauffe le four à 200 °C. Roule les endives dans le jambon, range-les dans un plat et nappe de béchamel.","timer":null},{"text":"Ajoute le maroilles en tranches et enfourne 25 min.","timer":{"label":"Four","min":25}}]},{"title":"Galettes de sarrasin complètes","intro":"Les galettes bretonnes complètes : jambon, œuf et emmental.","minutes":40,"calories":420,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"buckwheat galette ham egg cheese","veg":false,"oven":false,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Spécialité bretonne","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"farine de sarrasin","plural":"farine de sarrasin","qty":250,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"œuf","plural":"œufs","qty":5,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"jambon blanc","plural":"jambon blanc","qty":4,"unit":"tranches","have":false},{"name":"emmental râpé","plural":"emmental râpé","q